  "batch": "stage6-41",
  "date": "2026-11-11",
  "status": "Functional batch verified; complete Wine acceptance remains FAIL",
  "changes": [
    "Implement Fetch4 level-zero gathers with D3D footprint/channel ordering, sampler swizzles, fixed-function projected shadow comparisons and opaque-black unbound programmable samplers.",
    "Apply TEXBEM displacement after texture projection, support sRGB 3D views and texture-bound sampler dimensions, zero unwritten SM3 varyings and quantize legacy color interpolators.",
    "Give NULL-format targets depth-only extents without retaining color contents.",
    "Validate invalid ps3 POSITION0 declarations before allocation; support ordinary-texture autogen-filter no-ops, native color UpdateTexture conversion and format-conversion queries.",
    "Correct Direct3D sphere mapping to use the reflected Z-minus-one pole and preserve normal length unless NORMALIZENORMALS is enabled.",
    "Synchronize the previous batch40 evidence into the v86 review document."
  ],
